# Cohort source workbooks. These carry per-student staff assessment — segment,
# confidence, top-student and priority flags, readiness tiers, gaps, mentor
# notes, a loan flag — against named students. `pnpm data:profiles` reads them
# and writes only the safe fields to data/profiles.json, which is committed.
# The sources themselves must not enter git history.
# Match the source workbooks only. The derived data/profiles.json and
# data/archetypes.json are safe by construction and are committed.
/data/*Readiness*.xls*
/data/*Segmentation*.xls*
/data/*Curation*.xls*
/data/*Evidence_Book*.xls*
/data/Hackathon*Types*.xls*
/data/Hackathon*Types*.csv
